    {
      "id": "techbrief",
      "elType": "container",
      "settings": {
        "content_width": "full",
        "html_tag": "section",
        "flex_direction": "column",
        "css_classes": "studio-section technology-brief",
        "_element_id": "technology"
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "techh2",
          "elType": "widget",
          "widgetType": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "The right technology starts with your requirements.",
            "header_size": "h2"
          },
          "elements": []
        },
        {
          "id": "techintro",
          "elType": "widget",
          "widgetType": "text-editor",
          "settings": {
            "editor": "<p>We build tailored software, web applications, APIs, integrations and websites. We choose languages, frameworks and platforms around your business requirements, budget, scalability, security and existing infrastructure—not a one-size-fits-all stack.</p><p>Tell us about your current systems and any technology preferences. We will discuss suitable options, trade-offs and a proposed scope before development.</p>"
          },
          "elements": []
        },
        {
          "id": "techoptions",
          "elType": "widget",
          "widgetType": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "tabs": [
              {
                "_id": "techopts",
                "tab_title": "Explore technology options",
                "tab_content": "<dl class=\"technology-options\"><dt>Frontend</dt><dd>JavaScript, TypeScript, React, Next.js, Vue.js, Angular, HTML5 and CSS3</dd><dt>Backend</dt><dd>Python, Node.js, PHP, Java, C#, .NET and Go</dd><dt>Mobile applications</dt><dd>Kotlin, Swift, React Native and Flutter</dd><dt>Databases</dt><dd>PostgreSQL, MySQL, Microsoft SQL Server, MongoDB and Redis</dd><dt>Cloud &amp; DevOps</dt><dd>AWS, Microsoft Azure, Google Cloud, Docker, Kubernetes and CI/CD pipelines</dd><dt>APIs &amp; integrations</dt><dd>REST APIs, GraphQL, webhooks and third-party business system integrations</dd><dt>AI &amp; automation</dt><dd>Python-based AI/ML solutions, LLM integrations, workflow automation and intelligent business tools</dd><dt>CMS &amp; e-commerce</dt><dd>WordPress, WooCommerce and other suitable platforms</dd></dl><p>These are technology options depending on project scope. They do not imply every technology is currently deployed or that every service is a standardized product. Delivery capability, integrations and platform requirements are confirmed in your proposal.</p>"
              }
            ],
            "active_item": 0
          },
          "elements": []
        },
        {
          "id": "techcta",
          "elType": "widget",
          "widgetType": "button",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Discuss Your Project",
            "link": {
              "url": "#inquiry"
            },
            "_css_classes": "studio-button studio-primary",
            "_element_width": "auto"
          },
          "elements": []
        }
